course: dictionary
lesson: 1871
title: Colic: a tummy pain
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Colic means bad pain in the tummy. It can happen to a young baby, who cries for a long time for no clear reason, often in the evenings. Look at the clues around the word: a crying baby with a sore tummy is a baby with colic.
explain: «Horses ... a tummy ache called colic can be very dangerous for a horse.» The clues here are dangerous and tummy ache. So colic is a serious tummy pain, and a horse with colic needs a vet quickly.
explain: The same word can mean different things in different places. Always check: if your meaning fits the sentence, you have probably found it.
fact: Colic means bad pain in the tummy.
fact: A baby with colic often cries for a long time, usually in the evenings, and for no clear reason.
fact: Colic in babies usually gets better on its own after a few months.
fact: In horses, colic is a serious tummy pain that needs a vet quickly.
fact: «Colicky» is used to describe a baby who has colic.
exercise: In «a baby with colic», what is colic? | A soft toy that helps babies sleep | A type of cold weather | *Bad pain in the tummy | A kind of baby milk
exercise: A horse rolls a lot and seems in pain. What might it have, so the owner calls the vet? | A new saddle | *Colic | An itchy coat from dust | A long, happy gallop
exercise: «...a tummy ache called colic can be very dangerous for a horse.» Find and copy one word that shows colic is serious. | horse | called | stomach | *dangerous
test: A new baby cries for hours in the evening. Her parents say she has colic. What does this most likely mean? | *She has bad tummy pain and cries for a long time | She has a new toy | She is sleepy and happy | She is cold and wants a hat
test: Why do owners call a vet when a horse rolls and seems in pain? | *It may have colic, a serious tummy pain | It wants to be scratched | It is playing a game | It is tired after a long ride
exam: Which is true about colic in babies? | *It usually gets better on its own after a few months | It is caused by sunny weather | It always lasts for years | It only happens to horses
